{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星陳意涵日前上好友陶晶瑩的《陶色新聞》電台節目，提到19年前第一次在《我要變成硬柿子》電視劇做女主角，因為哭不出來被導演放棄，並痛罵「憑甚麼演女主角」，也對曾經歷整部戲份演出遭刪剪有陰影。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;陳</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T20:20:38.544778+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T20:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:11.683318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:11.683318+00:00","content_hash":"d543c1d358e10c2d8ebd982af7eb81fa16ee35243c8a95db616c22e6c65674a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}